  GameOverMusic: {fileID: 1812957917}
  currentBuildingCost: 0
  storyLines:
  - "Player: The autumn never ends because the land itself is rotting from below.
    The house is no longer just a structure \u2014 it is a seal"
  - 'Player: And something is trying to break it.'
  - "Player: The forest isn\u2019t just angry\u2026 it\u2019s dying."
  - "Witch: Because beneath it\u2026 something ancient stirs."
  - 'Crocodile: The ground cracks. The hunger rises.'
  - "Player: I don\u2019t know what\u2019s under that house. But I won\u2019t let
    you reach it."
  - 'Golem: Stone remembers. Stone obeys the one below.'
  - "Player: The one below\u2026?"
  - "Worm: Release\u2026 the Devourer\u2026"
  - "Player: So that\u2019s what this is about."
  - "Worm: The seal breaks\u2026 with your fall."
  - "Player: Then I guess I\u2019m not falling."
